  "title": "Interview Agent users",
  "description": "Users, their activity, interview quotas and sign-ins, from the interview agent's OpenTelemetry metrics: counts by fixed categories only, never who. Users and quotas are gauges the API recounts from the database every minute, each panel showing the most recent count any API instance reported. Events are cumulative series; each panel takes a series' last value in its window minus its last value before the window, and a series that is new in the window counts in full.",
